    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Havenhold</strong> is an <strong>Action Sandbox MMO</strong> set in a mythic world inspired by the ancient Far East, where warrior monks clash in brutal, player-driven warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wield</strong> <strong>powerful Primordial Avatars</strong>\u00a0and engage in real-time <strong>conflict between rival Mountain Sects</strong>. Experience dynamic combat with\u00a0<strong>parry, block, and directional attacks</strong> in skill-based duels, large-scale <strong>20v20 siege wars</strong>, and chaotic open-world skirmishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outside of battle, craft gear, gather resources, and make strategic choices to build your tribe\u2019s power. <strong>Construct, conquer, and ascend</strong> the sacred peak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtest gift code:\u00a0STE1245</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PRIMORDIAL AVATARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover and wield the powers of ancient primordials, each with their own unique set of abilities. Unlock and level up abilities to customize and evolve your play style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/4efc83afdc9b8f2eed17d4206336ec8c.poster.avif?t=1751903604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/4efc83afdc9b8f2eed17d4206336ec8c.webm?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/4efc83afdc9b8f2eed17d4206336ec8c.mp4?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ALL OUT WAR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory in <i>Havenhold</i> isn\u2019t just about skill\u2014it\u2019s about commanding the battlefield. Seasonal warfare erupts between rival factions, where every player\u2019s contribution can shift the tides of conflict. Rally your allies, coordinate large-scale assaults, and siege enemy strongholds in brutal PvP battles.\u00a0Only through strategy, synergy, and sheer force will your faction rise to claim the peak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/e5541a0cb4a1b36c64e3fce7382bf83b.poster.avif?t=1751903604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/e5541a0cb4a1b36c64e3fce7382bf83b.webm?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/e5541a0cb4a1b36c64e3fce7382bf83b.mp4?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRADE EVERYTHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From resources and consumables, to crafted gear and cosmetics, trade with other players and accumulate wealth. The world of Havenhold is built upon a player economy where everything has value.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/5591a3c96ece4323bcbcae0c3ad6c483.poster.avif?t=1751903604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/5591a3c96ece4323bcbcae0c3ad6c483.webm?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/5591a3c96ece4323bcbcae0c3ad6c483.mp4?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE MOUNTAIN CALLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're engaged in small skirmishes or larger PvP battles, the stakes are high, and the competition is fierce. Work with your allies, compete for access to the sacred peak - and claim your place at the end of each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/440f808663ed641ccdd8861e12d1367b.poster.avif?t=1751903604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/440f808663ed641ccdd8861e12d1367b.webm?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/440f808663ed641ccdd8861e12d1367b.mp4?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Havenhold</strong> is an <strong>Action Sandbox MMO</strong> set in a mythic world inspired by the ancient Far East, where warrior monks clash in brutal, player-driven warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wield</strong> <strong>powerful Primordial Avatars</strong>\u00a0and engage in real-time <strong>conflict between rival Mountain Sects</strong>. Experience dynamic combat with\u00a0<strong>parry, block, and directional attacks</strong> in skill-based duels, large-scale <strong>20v20 siege wars</strong>, and chaotic open-world skirmishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outside of battle, craft gear, gather resources, and make strategic choices to build your tribe\u2019s power. <strong>Construct, conquer, and ascend</strong> the sacred peak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtest gift code:\u00a0STE1245</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PRIMORDIAL AVATARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover and wield the powers of ancient primordials, each with their own unique set of abilities. Unlock and level up abilities to customize and evolve your play style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/4efc83afdc9b8f2eed17d4206336ec8c.poster.avif?t=1751903604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/4efc83afdc9b8f2eed17d4206336ec8c.webm?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/4efc83afdc9b8f2eed17d4206336ec8c.mp4?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ALL OUT WAR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory in <i>Havenhold</i> isn\u2019t just about skill\u2014it\u2019s about commanding the battlefield. Seasonal warfare erupts between rival factions, where every player\u2019s contribution can shift the tides of conflict. Rally your allies, coordinate large-scale assaults, and siege enemy strongholds in brutal PvP battles.\u00a0Only through strategy, synergy, and sheer force will your faction rise to claim the peak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/e5541a0cb4a1b36c64e3fce7382bf83b.poster.avif?t=1751903604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/e5541a0cb4a1b36c64e3fce7382bf83b.webm?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/e5541a0cb4a1b36c64e3fce7382bf83b.mp4?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRADE EVERYTHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From resources and consumables, to crafted gear and cosmetics, trade with other players and accumulate wealth. The world of Havenhold is built upon a player economy where everything has value.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/5591a3c96ece4323bcbcae0c3ad6c483.poster.avif?t=1751903604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/5591a3c96ece4323bcbcae0c3ad6c483.webm?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/5591a3c96ece4323bcbcae0c3ad6c483.mp4?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE MOUNTAIN CALLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're engaged in small skirmishes or larger PvP battles, the stakes are high, and the competition is fierce. Work with your allies, compete for access to the sacred peak - and claim your place at the end of each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/440f808663ed641ccdd8861e12d1367b.poster.avif?t=1751903604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/440f808663ed641ccdd8861e12d1367b.webm?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015760/extras/440f808663ed641ccdd8861e12d1367b.mp4?t=1751903604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
